---
---
<section class="quote-section" aria-label="Filosofía de Sofía Marcela Pedraza">
  <div class="quote-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="q-shape q-shape-1"></div>
    <div class="q-shape q-shape-2"></div>
    <div class="q-shape q-shape-3"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container quote-inner">
    <div class="quote-mark-top reveal" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg width="72" height="52" viewBox="0 0 72 52" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M0 52V31.2C0 20.4 2.6 12.2667 7.8 6.8C13 1.33333 20.3333 0 29.8 0V8.4C22.7333 9.46667 17.9333 12.2667 15.4 16.8C12.8667 21.3333 11.6 27.4667 11.6 35.2H24V52H0ZM48 52V31.2C48 20.4 50.6 12.2667 55.8 6.8C61 1.33333 68.3333 0 77.8 0V8.4H72C70.8 9.46667 66.0667 12.4 59.8 16.8C57.4 21.3333 56.2 27.4667 56.2 35.2H68.4V52H48Z" fill="rgba(172,119,247,0.25)"/>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="quote-text reveal delay-100">
      <p>
        La psicología más poderosa no es la que viene de los libros,
        sino la que nace de <em>escuchar de verdad</em> a las personas.
      </p>
    </blockquote>

    <footer class="quote-author reveal delay-200">
      <div class="author-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="author-info">
        <img
          src="/assets/images/psicologa-sin-fondo-3.png"
          alt="Sofía Marcela Pedraza Lozano"
          class="author-photo"
          width="60"
          height="60"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div>
          <cite class="author-name">Sofía Marcela Pedraza Lozano</cite>
          <p class="author-role">Psicóloga Clínica y Comunitaria · Yopal, Casanare</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- Mission statement -->
    <div class="quote-pillars reveal delay-300" aria-label="Pilares de atención">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span>Escucha activa y sin prejuicios</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span>Enfoque territorial llanero</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
            <path d="M21 12c0 1.2-.504 2.274-1.312 3.03C18.866 15.787 18 16.4 18 17.6V18c0 .6-.4 1-1 1h-1a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-.4c0-1.2-.866-1.813-1.688-2.57A4.99 4.99 0 0 1 12 12a5 5 0 0 1 5-5c.128 0 .254.005.38.016M12 7v.01"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span>Lenguaje cercano y comprensible</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span>Accesibilidad para todo el Casanare</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quote-section {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--grad-hero);
    padding: var(--space-24) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .quote-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .q-shape {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .q-shape-1 {
    width: 700px;
    height: 700px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 0%, transparent 70%);
    top: -200px;
    right: -200px;
  }

  .q-shape-2 {
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(210,149,255,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    bottom: -100px;
    left: -100px;
  }

  .q-shape-3 {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(172,119,247,0.2);
    top: 40%;
    left: 20%;
    animation: rotate-slow 40s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes rotate-slow {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to   { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  .quote-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  /* Big quotation marks */
  .quote-mark-top {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* Main quote */
  .quote-text {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .quote-text p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(var(--text-2xl), 4vw, var(--text-5xl));
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .quote-text em {
    font-style: normal;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color5) 0%, var(--color4) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  /* Author */
  .quote-author {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .author-line {
    width: 48px;
    height: 2px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  }

  .author-info {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .author-photo {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    border: 2px solid rgba(210,149,255,0.4);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(59,29,225,0.4));
  }

  .author-name {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .author-role {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* Pillars */
  .quote-pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-4);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .quote-pillars { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  }

  .pillar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    text-align: center;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-4);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    transition: background var(--dur-base), border-color var(--dur-base), transform var(--dur-base);
  }

  .pillar:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    border-color: rgba(172,119,247,0.4);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: rgba(172,119,247,0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color5);
  }

  .pillar span {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .q-shape-3 { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
